@startuml U15_case_lifecycle_state
!include style.iuml
title U15 — Case lifecycle (state machine, Sprint 3; update of 05, Migrating removed)

[*] --> New
New --> Running : start trigger\n/ CaseStarted, first tokens
New --> Failed : start inputs missing
Running --> Running : task replies, decisions,\nsplits and joins
Running --> Completed : End fires and no token is left\n/ CaseCompleted
Running --> Failed : task failed for good, no fallback\nor a decision cannot be evaluated\n/ CaseFailed, cancel tokens
Running --> Compensated : failure with undo actions\n(Sprint 4, ENG-08)
Running --> Cancelled : cancelled by staff (Sprint 4)
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Compensated --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Completed
  I4: every case ends in exactly one
  of the four final states; later
  messages are recorded and ignored.
end note
@enduml
